@base = http://localhost:9090

### NOTE: run 'Log in' (in the AUTH section below) first; entries use its token.

### Create an entry
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Day 1", "body": "Built my first real Go API."}

### List entries
GET {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Get one entry (paste an id from the list)
GET {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Update it
PUT {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "Day 1 (edited)", "body": "Built my first real Go API, with sqlc."}

### Delete it
DELETE {{base}}/entries/PASTE-ENTRY-ID
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### --- These should FAIL ---

### No token → 401
GET {{base}}/entries

### Empty entry → 422
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title": "", "body": "   "}

### Typo in field name → 400
POST {{base}}/entries
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"titel": "oops"}

### Bad id → 400
GET {{base}}/entries/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### ===== AUTH (Day 2) =====

### Sign up
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"Sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery","display_name":"Sushant"}

### Log in
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery"}

### Refresh (paste the refresh_token from the login response). Run it TWICE:
### the second call must return 401 (reuse detection).
POST {{base}}/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"PASTE-REFRESH-TOKEN"}

### Log out
POST {{base}}/auth/logout
Content-Type: application/json

{"refresh_token":"PASTE-REFRESH-TOKEN"}

### Wrong password -> 401
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"wrong-password-here"}

### Duplicate signup -> 409
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"sushant@example.com","password":"correct-horse-battery"}

### Weak password -> 422
POST {{base}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"new@example.com","password":"short"}


### Who am I (needs a token)
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Forged token -> 401
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer not.a.real.token

### Delete my account (permanent!)
DELETE {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.access_token}}
